<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Default IO implementation, use standard IO operations. </para>



<para><note><title>Note</title>

<para>An instance of this class can exist without a valid file handle attached to it. All calls fail, but the instance can nevertheless be used with no restrictions. </para>
</note>
</para>
</section>
